# `strlen` counts Unicode scalar values, not bytes.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/edge/unicode.csv'
| project id, name, n = strlen(name)
| sort by id asc
---- expected
id   | name    | n
long | string  | long
-----+---------+-----
   1 | Zoë     |    3
   2 | José    |    4
   3 | 李雷      |    2
   4 | Даша    |    4
   5 | سارة    |    4
   6 | émile  |    6
   7 | 😀 smile |    7
